              "ms": 13
            },
            "stem": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The scientists used the chi-squared ( χ <sup>2</sup>) test to compare their data to the expected phenotypic ratio of 9 : 3 : 3 : 1. The formula for the chi-squared test is shown in Fig. 4.3.",
                "source": {
                  "qp": 14
