                "id": "fig4.3",
                "caption": "Fig. 4.3",
                "src": "figures/q4_fig4_3.png",
                "alt": "Chi-squared formula with a summation sign and stacked squared-difference fraction, with the key defining observed and expected values.",
                "source": {
                  "qp": 14
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Complete Table 4.1 and use the chi-squared formula in Fig. 4.3 to calculate the χ <sup>2</sup> value for these data.",
                "source": {
                  "qp": 14
